※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4623 LANG_CONTAINER_CANNOT_COPY

※ An element whose allocator does not last as long as its container is copied into the
※ container's, and a record holding text cannot be copied yet: what its fields point into would
※ want a walk of its own.  Text in the image would have gone in as it is.

type R = f: str

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let a: mut arena = ⎕arena
    defer ⎕empty(a)
    let b: mut arena = ⎕arena
    defer ⎕empty(b)
    let l: [R] = [R(.f ← "x" ⧺ "y" in b)] in a
    if #l = 1: 0u6 else: 1u6
